==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 17.33~22.67 seconds<sup>520f~680f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16 seconds<sup>300f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 62.67~66 seconds<sup>1,880f~1,980f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Guile (Enemy)|Guile]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 16~21.33 seconds<sup>480f~640f</sup>.
**3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 14~16 seconds<sup>420f~480f</sup>.
**2 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 59.33~62.67 seconds<sup>1,780f~1,880f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Long ranged units such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] and [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Crimson Mina]] can easily outrange Guile. If you have [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] (or any other units who have 420+ range), they can be used to deal consistent chip damage to the boss. [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]] in particular is a perfect counter to this stage, but still include other basic meatshields as well.

